# Gate evidence lives in plans/<plan>/evidence/<gate>/<UTC ts>/.
# Git keeps each run directory's verdict layer. Raw output (traces, logs, pod
# dumps, captures) stays in the host evidence archive and is bound to git by
# the run directory's evidence-sha256.txt. To keep a raw file in git, promote it
# to plans/<plan>/reference/ or add a commented negation here; never git add -f.
/*/evidence/*/*/**
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/verdict.json
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/gate.log
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/exit_code
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/watchdog.log
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/checks.jsonl
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/checks/*.out
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/facts.jsonl
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/rt-readers-*.txt
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/refresh-ric-*
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/*-sha256.txt
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/*.manifest.json
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/versions*.txt
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/images.txt
# Agent unit-test output (small text octet dumps): the only record of the R-6 admission paths.
!/*/evidence/p03-unit/**
# Offline PPID 70 proofs (agent loopback, judge fixtures, self-test): small text, no captures.
!/*/evidence/p05-ppid-offline/**
# The PDCP SN wrap suite's red-then-green proof (test.py and test-runner output, small text).
!/*/evidence/p10-sn-wrap/**
# A run directory's comparison against a committed reference (reference-compare.py output): a small verdict.
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/reference-compare*.json
# Its transform-compare against the M9 files (reference-transform-compare.py output and its self-test lines).
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/reference-transform-compare*.json
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/reference-transform-selftest.txt
# The pinned protoc toolchain proof (tools/protoc-pinned/protoc-pinned-proof.sh): a small verdict with tool versions.
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/proof.json
# Its generate mode's record for a changed proto: tool versions and the sha256 of each generated file.
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/generate.json
# Host /home free and active-overlay size at each gate boundary (vm-exec.sh): the per-step disk measurement.
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/host-disk.tsv
# The host disk watchdog's per-run record (vm-exec.sh): threshold, minimum free GiB seen, tripped.
!/*/evidence/*/*/**/host-disk-watchdog.json
# The M9 run directory is the run-level record: keep its top-level files.
!/*/evidence/m9/*/*
# A gate chain's procedure record: the driver copy, its step log and its per-step runner logs (small text).
!/*/evidence/cp2-chain/**
!/*/evidence/p10-chain/**
# A chain pre-flight probe's ns-3 build stderr is raw output (the archive keeps it).
/*/evidence/p10-chain/*/preflight/tree.stderr
# Host live state, rewritten by every run (steps.tsv and m9/<ts>/ keep the values).
/*/evidence/.last-*
/*/evidence/watchdog/
# Captures never go to git, whatever their name.
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.pcap.gz
